        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "While the ideal of total memetic control remains out of reach, Zack's present capacity is entirely adequate for his objective."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 217,
        "ActionId": 217,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "His control of the Corrupted is a direct application of this property. Its mechanism is not authentic Ascension-Network dominance but rather—mirroring Amberia's function—a form of authority over machinery of Arctic origin."
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 218,
        "ActionId": 218,
        "Type": 301,
        "Params": [
            "",
            "Zack",
            "Now I can activate more memetics, manipulate more foundational thoughts... No one can resist what is etched into their very soul!"
        ]
    },
    {
        "Id": 219,
        "ActionId": 219,
        "Type": 301,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "Params": [
            "",
            "",
            "To him now, the Corrupted, the Ascendants, even Babylonia itself are no longer obstacles."
        ]
    },
